{"name": "Skeptikos", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skeptikos is the first solo game from DustWyrm Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/800a5b5157c936810c0aef2127cf08af.poster.avif?t=1783945976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/800a5b5157c936810c0aef2127cf08af.webm?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/800a5b5157c936810c0aef2127cf08af.mp4?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the puzzles that stand before you, master the mechanics that get in your way. Accept that sometimes you must shut down in order to move forward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn off your power to respawn further away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/ba7b1feea71f92cdc189c5353b251664.poster.avif?t=1783945976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/ba7b1feea71f92cdc189c5353b251664.webm?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/ba7b1feea71f92cdc189c5353b251664.mp4?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut gravity to stop falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/0f2e4df32b09cbb9b796b7a287e46edd.poster.avif?t=1783945976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/0f2e4df32b09cbb9b796b7a287e46edd.webm?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/0f2e4df32b09cbb9b796b7a287e46edd.mp4?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the protogun to reach new targets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/f9bb822297778fd3b7756522bebd8333.poster.avif?t=1783945976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/f9bb822297778fd3b7756522bebd8333.webm?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/extras/f9bb822297778fd3b7756522bebd8333.mp4?t=1783945976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of an android in a mysterious training facility. Learn to control your environment while your supervisors awkwardly try to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through your training, uncover the secrets of this place, collect... Mugs?<br/>And above all, who is Dan?</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Skeptikos is a solo game taking place in a strange formation center. Resolve the puzzles, find the secrets around here.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631130/752c1823ac65cb716f5b50f0d5ac7609ddc6402b/header.jpg?t=1783945976", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle Platformer", "FPS", "Hidden Object", "First-Person", "Indie"], "developers": "DustWyrmStudio", "publishers": "DustWyrmStudio", "release_date": "Jul 13, 2026", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "4631130", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/SBiUdBclkUA", "first_seen": 1782424800.0, "review_rank": 369}